~ start
$> GlobalVars.visited_superette = true
Yvonne: Mhhhh?
- Hey, ummm, I saw that there was a cake for sale?
	$> title = "quick_start"
	Yvonne: Why do you care?
	- It's my little sibling"s birthday today
		if GlobalVars.bought_cake_bakery:
			Yvonne: And your fat ass wanted a second cake?
			$> title = "neutral_ending"
			=> END
		else:
			Yvonne: Who asked
			- You... Nevermind...
				Yvonne: That's what I thought!
				Yvonne: Here you go, it'll be 15$.
				- ... Fine.
					=> buy_cake
				- That's a bit pricy, isn't it?
			- You did!
				Yvonne: Hmpf!
				Yvonne: It'll be 50$.
				- ... Fine.
					=> buy_cake
				- 50$? That's ridiculous!
			- How about I pay you money and you give me my cake!
				Yvonne: Geez... Don't be such a fun killer.
				Yvonne: Here you go, it'll be 30$.
				- ... Fine.
					=> buy_cake
				- 30$? That's expensive
			
			Yvonne: You got anywhere else to go?
			if GlobalVars.visited_bakery:
				- ...
					=> buy_cake
				- You know what! I do actually!
					Yvonne: Then stop wasting my fricking time!!!
					$> title = "bad_ending"
					=> END
			else:
				- ...
					=> buy_cake
	- Nevermind...
- Nevermind...
=> END

~ quick_start
Yvonne: So, you finally decided to buy this cake or what
- Yes
	=> buy_cake
- Nevermind...
=> END

~ buy_cake
$> GlobalVars.bought_cake_superette = true
Credit Card: [shake rate=20 level=10] BIIIP
Yvonne: Now get out!
$> title = "second_round"
=> END

~ second_round
Yvonne: Oh it's you... again!
if GlobalVars.visited_bakery:
	- Why did you lie about the bakery?
	Yvonne: I didn't, you're the one who forgot!
	- Why are you so mean
	Yvonne: ... Get out!
	$> title = "bad_ending"
else: 
	- ...
	- Nevermind
=> END

~ neutral_ending
Yvonne: Don't you have things to do?
=> END

~ bad_ending
Yvonne: Get out!
=> END

~ global70
